<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 8.19 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drop to 8.19 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 8.19 percent on Monday from 8.49 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded on the market in seven reported transactions with a total value of 11.55 million dinars ($16 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
